    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/7de8616cef787c798f25aea9aa6d9bc9.poster.avif?t=1747138770\" width=630 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/7de8616cef787c798f25aea9aa6d9bc9.webm?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/7de8616cef787c798f25aea9aa6d9bc9.mp4?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight enemies, collect gold and XP, loot chests, level-up your character, and clear dungeons, all by \u2013 you guessed it \u2013 clicking!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/97f1ae856a7578cb2150fa5fc5ecc531.poster.avif?t=1747138770\" width=630 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/97f1ae856a7578cb2150fa5fc5ecc531.webm?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/97f1ae856a7578cb2150fa5fc5ecc531.mp4?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Battle against a large array of enemy types and bosses, each of which require different strategies and playstyles to defeat. Choose from a variety of classes and utilize their unique attributes and abilities to out-smart, out-skill or just out-smash your opponents. In combat, timing is everything; watch for when enemies are ready strike you, and for when they are themselves vulnerable to attack.<br><br>Build and upgrade buildings to aid in your quest. Have your villagers help in gathering resources or train soldiers who may come in handy in fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/ae0cab780af45f1546b107fd2ab190c3.poster.avif?t=1747138770\" width=630 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/ae0cab780af45f1546b107fd2ab190c3.webm?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/ae0cab780af45f1546b107fd2ab190c3.mp4?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defeat Enemies and farm XP to level your character. Unlock perks throughout the campaign and progressively build your character into a force to be reckoned with.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/9c0b0a4b0b362646185330fa2326daa0.poster.avif?t=1747138770\" width=630 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/9c0b0a4b0b362646185330fa2326daa0.webm?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/9c0b0a4b0b362646185330fa2326daa0.mp4?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose from a motley crew of classes, each with their own skills and abilities, as well as strengths and weaknesses. Cast powerful spells as a mighty wizard, summon undead warriors to fight for you as a necromancer, outsmart opponents as a cunning rouge, or just hit your opponents really hard in the face as a slightly-less-cunning barbarian.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer - coming soon!</h2>Team up with friends, combo abilities and work together to beat extra tough opponents.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And more...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Supports gamepad<br></li><li>Designed for Steamdeck</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/7de8616cef787c798f25aea9aa6d9bc9.poster.avif?t=1747138770\" width=630 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/7de8616cef787c798f25aea9aa6d9bc9.webm?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/7de8616cef787c798f25aea9aa6d9bc9.mp4?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight enemies, collect gold and XP, loot chests, level-up your character, and clear dungeons, all by \u2013 you guessed it \u2013 clicking!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/97f1ae856a7578cb2150fa5fc5ecc531.poster.avif?t=1747138770\" width=630 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/97f1ae856a7578cb2150fa5fc5ecc531.webm?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/97f1ae856a7578cb2150fa5fc5ecc531.mp4?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Battle against a large array of enemy types and bosses, each of which require different strategies and playstyles to defeat. Choose from a variety of classes and utilize their unique attributes and abilities to out-smart, out-skill or just out-smash your opponents. In combat, timing is everything; watch for when enemies are ready strike you, and for when they are themselves vulnerable to attack.<br><br>Build and upgrade buildings to aid in your quest. Have your villagers help in gathering resources or train soldiers who may come in handy in fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/ae0cab780af45f1546b107fd2ab190c3.poster.avif?t=1747138770\" width=630 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/ae0cab780af45f1546b107fd2ab190c3.webm?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/ae0cab780af45f1546b107fd2ab190c3.mp4?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defeat Enemies and farm XP to level your character. Unlock perks throughout the campaign and progressively build your character into a force to be reckoned with.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/9c0b0a4b0b362646185330fa2326daa0.poster.avif?t=1747138770\" width=630 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/9c0b0a4b0b362646185330fa2326daa0.webm?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717900/extras/9c0b0a4b0b362646185330fa2326daa0.mp4?t=1747138770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose from a motley crew of classes, each with their own skills and abilities, as well as strengths and weaknesses. Cast powerful spells as a mighty wizard, summon undead warriors to fight for you as a necromancer, outsmart opponents as a cunning rouge, or just hit your opponents really hard in the face as a slightly-less-cunning barbarian.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer - coming soon!</h2>Team up with friends, combo abilities and work together to beat extra tough opponents.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And more...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Supports gamepad<br></li><li>Designed for Steamdeck</li></ul>",
